Max files/folders in sub-root directory: 128
Disk bitmap size at full 16TiB capacity: 512MiB

file/folder entry format:
_____________________________________________________________________
| 16Byte |   4B    |         2B             |    2B    |     8B     |
|  name  | pointer | Size in Clusters(4KiB) | NO of PT | Attributes |

Partition entry format:
__________________________________________________
| 16B   | 1B            | 8B         | 4B   | ND | //ND == no data
| Lable | No of entries | Attributes | Size | 3B |

the prtition entry is the first entry in the root dir instead of file/folder entries

MBR entry format

0x00: Drive status (0x80 for active/ bootable)
0x01: STarting CHS address (Normaly left 0) 3bytes
0x04: Type of partition
0x05: Ending CHS address (This one is also normaly left 0) 3bytes
0x08: Starting LBA 4bytes
0x0C total sectors 4bytes